    qa: [
      { q: 'Why do opponents of punishment say tanking is hard to prove?', choices: ['Clubs rarely trade their experienced players to rivals.', 'Honest rebuilding can look exactly like losing on purpose.', 'Officials are not allowed to attend team meetings.', 'Injured stars usually refuse to sit out games.'], answer: 1, why: '第4段落で、若手との交換や若手の起用、主力の欠場はどれも正当な理由で説明でき、意図を見抜けないと述べられている。' },
      { q: 'What is the main aim of the middle position described in the sixth paragraph?', choices: ['To punish clubs more strictly for each defeat.', 'To give the worst team every top draft pick.', 'To ban draft lotteries in all professional leagues.', 'To make finishing last bring little real advantage.'], answer: 3, why: '第6段落で、下位チームの確率をそろえる抽選などにより、最下位で終える利点を小さくして負ける動機をなくそうとしている。' },
    ],
