    qa: [
      { q: 'Why is eating quickly so important for the star-nosed mole?', choices: ['Larger animals often steal its food.', 'Its tiny eyes cannot see moving worms.', 'Its prey gives little energy per item.', 'Its tunnels fill with water very quickly.'], answer: 2, why: '第4段落：獲物は一つあたりのエネルギーがごくわずかなので、時間がかかると探すのに使うエネルギーのほうが多くなりうるとある。' },
      { q: 'What happened when a fine screen was placed over the scent trail?', choices: ['The moles followed the trail more quickly.', 'The moles blew larger bubbles than before.', 'The moles used their eyes to find food.', 'The moles could no longer follow the trail.'], answer: 3, why: '第5段落：細かい網で泡がにおいに届かないようにすると、モグラはたどれなくなったとある。' },
    ],
